fasthttpc/public_suffix_list.dat.gz
===================================

This file is a snapshot of the Public Suffix List
(https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat), maintained by the
Public Suffix List project and contributors. The upstream VERSION and COMMIT
of the snapshot, and a link to that exact upstream source file, are recorded
at the top of the decompressed file.

It is a modified form of that file, produced by scripts/update_psl.py:
comments were dropped, internationalized labels were converted to A-labels
(punycode), and the result was gzip-compressed. The rules themselves are not
changed. The license notice of the original file is kept at the top of the
decompressed file:

    This Source Code Form is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public
    License, v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this
    file, You can obtain one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

